<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">achievements</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">achievements</ansi> command shows the accolades you have
earned and the ones still waiting for you, grouped by category, with your total
points. Points also feed the achievements leaderboard.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">achievements</ansi>           - Show all your accolades
  <ansi fg="command">achievements combat</ansi>    - Show one category (combat, exploration,
                            wealth, progression, quests)

Accolades unlock on their own as you play — you will be told when you earn one.
